{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nfywirl","type":"work","title":"歷代內侍考","authors":[{"name":"毛一公","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9befj"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《歷代內侍考》•十卷","author_info":"明毛一公撰","summary":"明毛一公撰。一公字震卿，遂安人，萬曆己丑進士，官至給事中。其書取古來閹寺事蹟輯為一編。自春秋及宋，以時代次之。各序其善惡而加以論斷，大旨褒少而貶多。一公，天啟末蘇州巡撫一鷺之兄也。一鷺党魏忠賢，事具《明史》。其兄此書，儻亦有為而作乎。","edition":"兩淮鹽政采進本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《歷代內侍考》十四卷","author_info":"明毛一公撰","summary":"《歷代內侍考》十四卷。明毛一公撰。影印浙江省圖書館藏清抄本。","edition":"影印浙江省圖書館藏清抄本","volume":"第517冊","section":"史部 史部"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《歴代內侍考》十四卷","author_info":"明毛一公撰","summary":"《歴代內侍考》十四卷。明毛一公撰。中國科學院圖書館藏清鈔本。","edition":"中國科學院圖書館藏清鈔本","volume":"第99冊","section":"史部"}],"juan_count":{"number":10},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-chaoben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02083745","metadata":{"edition":"抄本","version":"v8","total_page":566,"paragraph_count":692,"has_translation":true,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-keben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02048981","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v4","total_page":577,"paragraph_count":4575,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02083745.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC0517%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":517},"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%AD%B7%E4%BB%A3%E5%85%A7%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%83%28%E4%B8%80%29.djvu"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":10}],"measure_info":"十卷","description":{"text":"毛一公（明）撰。十卷；諸志所著之數有異，別作十四卷。見著錄於《欽定四庫全書總目》《續修四庫全書》《四庫全書存目叢書》。《續修四庫全書》列於